{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16977","headline":"奉和圣制丰年多庆九日示怀 · 武元衡","name":"奉和圣制丰年多庆九日示怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"令节寰宇泰，神都佳气浓。\n赓歌禹功盛，击壤尧年丰。\n九奏碧霄里，千官皇泽中。\n南山澄凝黛，曲水清涵空。\n金玉美王度，欢康谣国风。\n睿文垂日月，永与天无穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16977.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16977","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}